\begin{abstract}
  We introduce a new class of polylogarithm sums closely related to a family studied by L. Vepštas in 2010. These generalized sums depend on two free parameters and yield closed-form expressions involving the Dirichlet eta function. Additionally, we present an alternative proof for a hyperbolic sum originally discussed by Ramanujan.
