            There is a smooth family of maps $\{p_{L,b}: \partial_- A_{L,b} \to L_b \times S^{2k-1}\}_b$, such that each $p_{L,b}$ is a fibre bundle with fibres diffeomorphic to $D^l$ and structure group $O(l)$.
