Finally, the full nonlinear state $\ket*{\bol\psi^{nl}_n}$ for the first order discretized Lorenz model in Equation~\eqref{state definition 1} can be realized though the operator,
\begin{equation}\label{nonliner operator Lorenz 1}
\hat{U}_{nl}=\hat{U}_h^1+ \hat{U}_h^2(\hat{G}_1\otimes\hat{G}_0),\quad \hat{U}_h^1=\hat{1}_{8\times8},
