    At $\Delta=0$, the phase difference is exactly $\pi$.
    (d) On-resonance reflectivity $|r_j(\Delta=0)|^2$ as a function of the ratio $\kappa_{\text{ex}}/\kappa_{\text{in}}$, with the optimal $\kappa_{\text{ex}}^\mathrm{opt}$ indicated by the vertical dashed line (see text).
