\subsection{Power, Readout \& Services}
\label{sec:services}
The detector services, namely the power supply, the readout and possibly  water cooling come out from the top of the layers farthest from the beam axis as seen in Fig.~\ref{fig:detector_default} and~\ref{fig:detector_tilted}.
A sketch of the power supply and readout system is shown in Fig.~\ref{fig:ps_and_ro}.
The different elements are illustrated, including their locations and lengths.
