Each sensitive surface in ACTS representing an ALPIDE sensor is assigned a $256 \times 128$ grid, with the larger bin count corresponding to the chip's longer side.
The material properties of the vacuum chamber window are directly extracted from the \GEANT description, as sampling is unnecessary for this homogeneous bulk.

