\end{itemize}

\subsubsection{Indirect separation}\label{sec:indirect_separation}

In this section, we are dealing with the disconnection of the lumens once they have been segmented together. We propose the analysis of the following 5 cases.

\begin{itemize}
\item Sequence of erosions then dilations of connected lumens.

